    <string name="server_libraries">Libraries: %1$s</string>
    <string name="server_library_count_in_library">%1$s in the library</string>
    <string name="server_love_stars_lastfm">Love Navidrome stars on Last.fm</string>
    <string name="server_love_stars_lastfm_dialog_desc">Songs starred on Navidrome become favourites here; with this on they\'re also loved on Last.fm, and unstarring them unloves them. Favourites you change here are always loved or unloved on Last.fm (when it\'s connected), whatever this setting.\n\nIt applies to stars from now on: songs starred before aren\'t loved retroactively.</string>
    <string name="server_love_stars_lastfm_dialog_title">Stars and Last.fm</string>
    <string name="server_love_stars_lastfm_info">Songs starred on Navidrome become favourites here; with this on they\'re also loved on Last.fm, and unstarring them unloves them. It applies to stars from now on: songs starred before aren\'t loved retroactively.</string>
    <string name="server_password_label">Password</string>
    <string name="server_password_security_note">The password is stored encrypted on this phone and is never sent as is: each request is signed with it.</string>
    <string name="server_pending_plays_many">%1$s plays waiting to be sent to Navidrome</string>
    <string name="server_pending_plays_one">1 play waiting to be sent to Navidrome</string>
    <string name="server_report_other_plays">Report plays from other sources to Navidrome</string>
    <string name="server_report_other_plays_dialog_desc">Plays of songs on this device or Google Drive are also reported, to Navidrome\'s copy of the same song, so its play counts reflect all your listening.\n\nNavidrome\'s copy is found by artist and title, ignoring notes like \"(Remastered)\" but keeping live and demo versions apart (the same title and album first), so it can be imperfect: a song with several versions may be counted on a different version, and songs spelled differently aren\'t found. The same Last.fm warning applies.</string>
    <string name="server_report_other_plays_dialog_title">Plays from other sources</string>
    <string name="server_report_other_plays_info">Plays of songs on this device or Google Drive are also reported to Navidrome\'s copy of the same song, so its play counts reflect all your listening.</string>
    <string name="server_report_server_plays">Report Navidrome song plays</string>
    <string name="server_report_server_plays_dialog_desc">When a Navidrome song has played halfway, the app tells Navidrome, so its play counts and \"recently played\" include what you play here. The app scrobbles to Last.fm itself (Last.fm card).\n\nWarning: if scrobbling to Last.fm is also switched on in Navidrome (Personal settings → Last.fm), Navidrome forwards these plays to Last.fm as well, and they would be scrobbled twice.</string>
    <string name="server_report_server_plays_dialog_title">Navidrome song plays</string>
    <string name="server_scrobble_warning_info">When a Navidrome song has played halfway, the app tells Navidrome, so its play counts and \"recently played\" include what you play here. The app scrobbles to Last.fm itself (Last.fm settings).\nWarning: if scrobbling to Last.fm is also switched on in Navidrome (Personal settings → Last.fm), Navidrome forwards these plays to Last.fm as well, and they would be scrobbled twice.</string>
