    <string name="server_star_other_favourites">Star favourites from other sources on Navidrome</string>
    <string name="server_star_other_favourites_dialog_desc">Favourites of songs on this device or Google Drive are also starred on Navidrome\'s copy of the same song, and removing them unstars it. Unstarring that copy on Navidrome removes the favourite here too.\n\nNavidrome\'s copy is found by artist and title, ignoring notes like \"(Remastered)\" but keeping live and demo versions apart (the same title and album first), so it can be imperfect: a song with several versions may be starred on a different version, and songs spelled differently aren\'t found. Switching this off later leaves the stars on Navidrome as they are.</string>
