    <string name="sources_catalog_enrich_home_desc">Show trending charts and curated playlists on the Home tab</string>
    <string name="sources_catalog_explanation_discography">• Artist discography: view an artist\'s full studio &amp; live discography on their page and spot albums missing from your library.</string>
    <string name="sources_catalog_explanation_intro">Catalog integration brings the power of streaming services to your personal library:</string>
    <string name="sources_catalog_explanation_limitations">Limitations: MusicMinchas does not stream or plays audio from Deezer or Apple Music (playback always uses your own sources and/or Nebula addon, if configured). Public playlist search is power by Deezer public API.</string>
    <string name="sources_catalog_explanation_playlists">• Browse public playlists: discover curated playlists from Deezer and Apple Music and play the songs you already own.</string>
    <string name="sources_catalog_explanation_search">• Catalog search: find artists, albums and songs across Deezer &amp; Apple Music, matched against your Local, Google Drive and Navidrome library.</string>
    <string name="sources_catalog_explanation_what">What both contribute:\n• Catalog search: find artists, albums and songs across Deezer &amp; Apple Music, matched against your Local, Google Drive and Navidrome library.\n• Public playlists (Deezer): search curated and user playlists on Deezer and import them into Playlists using the songs you own.\n• Artist discography: view an artist\'s full studio &amp; live discography on their page and spot albums missing from your library.</string>
    <string name="sources_catalog_subtitle">Apple Music &amp; Deezer integrations</string>
